# Agile Toolkit — File-touch contract for the 14-squad MCP buildout.
#
# Conventions:
#   - Each squad owns its tool directories and a single action file.
#   - Foundation (S0) owns everything cross-cutting; no other squad may
#     touch S0-protected files. Squads needing infra changes open an
#     "infra-ask" issue → S0 batches daily.
#   - GitHub team handles are placeholders. Replace
#     `@agile-toolkit/squad-N` with the real team / user / agent identity
#     once configured. The slug indicates the squad's theme.
#
# Last-match-wins per GitHub CODEOWNERS rules — order matters.

